{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46365","headline":"夏日西霞寺书怀寄张逸人 · 齐己","name":"夏日西霞寺书怀寄张逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人中林下现，名自有闲忙。\n建业红尘热，栖霞白石凉。\n倚身柽几稳，洒面瀑流香。\n不似高斋里，花连竹影长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}